When we start our server there is a process which will start all the processes.If this process has not started then other processed will not run.

   What is that process? init process -- process id of init is 1

   we have different kinds of runlevels.

   0  -- halt or shutdown
   1  -- single user mode
   2  -- multi user mode without networking
   3  -- multi user mode with networking
   4  -- reserved or for developers
   5  -- multi user mode with networking and GUi.
   6  -- Restart

init 6  -- Which will restart ur server.

init 0 -- Which will shutdown your server

