   Parent and child process are communicating together and child has bee terminated without sending any signal to parent process and parent process will keep on sending signal for child which is terminated. Because of this memory will be lose and server parformance will be degraded. This process we can call it as Zombie process.

   Using top command we can findout the zombie processes.

